    {
      "bbox": [
        309,
        1191,
        2005,
        1427
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I would like to call your attention to an article entitled\nNEW YORK, NEW YORK -- IT'S A WONDERFUL TOWN, to appear in the July 1st issue\nof COLLIER'S, scheduled to go on the newsstands Thursday, June 22nd.",
